# Cursor Tooling

## Agents

- **code-reviewer** — reviews code for quality, security, and project conventions
- **docs-writer** — updates documentation after changes
- **smoke-tester** — runs E2E smoke tests on the container image
- **test-writer** — writes tests using pytest-asyncio and aiohttp test client

## Commands

- **/image-build** — build container image locally (uses podman if available)
- **/dockerfile-lint** — lint Dockerfile with hadolint
- **/lint** — run ruff linter and formatter checks
- **/test** — run pytest with coverage
- **/serve-docs** — build and serve MkDocs documentation locally
- **/stop-docs** — stop the MkDocs documentation server

## Skills

- **add-endpoint** — step-by-step guide for adding a new API endpoint
